# Which extraction backend /extract uses: mock | claude | openrouter | groq
# - mock:       free, fake data, for UI/flow testing without spending anything
# - claude:     Anthropic Claude, paid (needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
# - openrouter: genuinely free model (pricing 0/0, verified against
#               OpenRouter's own /api/v1/models), no cost, no card, but the
#               shared free pool can be slow/overloaded at peak times
#               (needs OPENROUTER_API_KEY)
# - groq:       free tier (no card, forever-free per Groq), runs on their
#               own fast LPU hardware -- less likely to be slow/overloaded
#               than OpenRouter's shared free pool (needs GROQ_API_KEY)
LIVRESCAN_PROVIDER=mock

# --- claude provider ---
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# LIVRESCAN_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001

# --- openrouter provider ---
# Free key from https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys (no card required)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# LIVRESCAN_OPENROUTER_MODEL=nex-agi/nex-n2.5-pro:free

# --- groq provider ---
# Free key from https://console.groq.com/keys (no card required)
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# LIVRESCAN_GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b

# --- auth / quota (see "Auth a kvóty" in README.md before setting these on
# the live app -- LIVRESCAN_APP_KEY breaks already-installed app builds
# that don't send it yet) ---
# LIVRESCAN_APP_KEY=
# LIVRESCAN_DAILY_PAGE_LIMIT=20

# --- error tracking (see "Sledování chyb" in README.md) ---
# Free DSN from https://sentry.io (Developer plan, 5000 events/month).
# Prázdné (výchozí) = vypnuto -- NENASTAVUJ při běhu testů.
# SENTRY_DSN=
